        _t['intro'] = _t['intro'].replace('All questions are written by Lemonmath;', 'On the real exam about 60% of the score comes from AB topics; this practice exam leans on the BC-only units (27 of the 42 questions: Euler and logistic models, further integration, parametric, vector and polar functions, series), because the AB topics are already covered in the [AB practice exam](lesson:apcalc-practice-exam-ab). All questions are written by Lemonmath;')
